---
import Icon from '../ui/Icon.astro';
---

<section id="contacto" class="relative py-24 md:py-32">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 md:px-6">
    <div class="reveal relative rounded-3xl overflow-hidden border border-white/10" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02)">
      <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0"><img src="https://picsum.photos/seed/ocean-sunset-warm/1400/700.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="w-full h-full object-cover opacity-15" /><div class="absolute inset-0" style="background:linear-gradient(to top,#050505,rgba(5,5,5,0.8),rgba(5,5,5,0.4))"></div></div>
      <div class="relative z-10 grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 p-8 md:p-16">
        <div>
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-cyan-400 mb-4">Comenzá ahora</p>
          <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight leading-tight mb-6"><span class="bg-clip-text text-transparent" style="background-image:linear-gradient(to right,#fff,#94a3b8)">Cotizá tu envío a Isla de Pascua</span></h2>
          <p class="text-lg text-slate-400 leading-relaxed mb-8">Te enviamos la cotización detallada a tu correo en menos de 2 horas.</p>
          <div class="space-y-4">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3"><div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center bg-cyan-500/10"><Icon name="phone" width={16} height={16} class="text-cyan-400" /></div><div><div class="text-sm font-medium text-white">+56 32 210 8800</div><div class="text-xs text-slate-500">Lunes a viernes 08:00–18:00</div></div></div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3"><div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center bg-cyan-500/10"><Icon name="mail" width={16} height={16} class="text-cyan-400" /></div><div><div class="text-sm font-medium text-white">cargo@taina.cl</div><div class="text-xs text-slate-500">Respuesta en menos de 2 hrs</div></div></div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3"><div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center bg-cyan-500/10"><Icon name="map-pin" width={16} height={16} class="text-cyan-400" /></div><div><div class="text-sm font-medium text-white">Terminal 2, Puerto Valparaíso</div><div class="text-xs text-slate-500">Oficina principal</div></div></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <form id="quoteForm" class="space-y-4">
            <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4"><div><label class="block text-xs font-medium text-slate-400 mb-1.5" for="qNombre">Nombre</label><input id="qNombre" name="nombre" type="text" required placeholder="Tu nombre" class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-xl text-sm text-white placeholder-slate-600 border border-white/10 focus:border-cyan-500/50 focus:outline-none transition-colors" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03)" /></div><div><label class="block text-xs font-medium text-slate-400 mb-1.5" for="qEmpresa">Empresa</label><input id="qEmpresa" name="empresa" type="text" placeholder="Tu empresa" class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-xl text-sm text-white placeholder-slate-600 border border-white/10 focus:border-cyan-500/50 focus:outline-none transition-colors" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03)" /></div></div>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4"><div><label class="block text-xs font-medium text-slate-400 mb-1.5" for="qEmail">Email</label><input id="qEmail" name="email" type="email" required placeholder="correo@empresa.cl" class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-xl text-sm text-white placeholder-slate-600 border border-white/10 focus:border-cyan-500/50 focus:outline-none transition-colors" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03)" /></div><div><label class="block text-xs font-medium text-slate-400 mb-1.5" for="qTelefono">Teléfono</label><input id="qTelefono" name="telefono" type="tel" placeholder="+56 9 XXXX XXXX" class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-xl text-sm text-white placeholder-slate-600 border border-white/10 focus:border-cyan-500/50 focus:outline-none transition-colors" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03)" /></div></div>
            <div><label class="block text-xs font-medium text-slate-400 mb-1.5" for="qTipo">Tipo de carga</label><select id="qTipo" name="tipo_carga" required class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-xl text-sm text-white border border-white/10 focus:border-cyan-500/50 focus:outline-none transition-colors appearance-none cursor-pointer" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03)"><option value="" class="bg-slate-900">Seleccioná</option><option value="Pallets" class="bg-slate-900">Pallets</option><option value="Contenedor FCL" class="bg-slate-900">Contenedor FCL</option><option value="Carga LCL" class="bg-slate-900">Carga LCL</option><option value="Vehículos" class="bg-slate-900">Vehículos</option></select></div>
            <div><label class="block text-xs font-medium text-slate-400 mb-1.5" for="qDetalle">Detalle</label><textarea id="qDetalle" name="detalle" rows="3" placeholder="Cantidad de pallets, peso estimado..." class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-xl text-sm text-white placeholder-slate-600 border border-white/10 focus:border-cyan-500/50 focus:outline-none transition-colors resize-none" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03)"></textarea></div>
            <button type="submit" class="cta-btn-sq w-full inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-xl transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-0.5 cursor-pointer" style="background:linear-gradient(to right,#0c2d48,#134e4a);box-shadow:0 0 40px -10px rgba(34,211,238,0.3)">Enviar Cotización a mi Correo <Icon name="mail" width={16} height={16} /></button>
            <div id="formSuccess" class="hidden text-center py-3 px-4 rounded-xl text-sm font-medium text-teal-400 border border-teal-500/20" style="background:rgba(20,184,166,0.1)"><Icon name="check-circle" width={16} height={16} class="inline-block mr-1" /> ¡Listo! Revisa tu cliente de correo: envía el mensaje preparado para recibir tu cotización.</div>
          </form>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
